{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾演過《庶務二課》、《HERO》等不少知名日劇的62歲日本綠葉男星岡山一，昨日(27日)在社交網報喜，宣布與29歲女演員杜菜摘結婚。</p><p>兩人年紀足足相差33歲，岡山表示：「雖然我們有一些年齡差距，但是會共同建立溫暖的家庭。</p><p>今後也請各位多多指教。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T06:02:15.670840+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:50:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.019152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:58:48.019152+00:00","content_hash":"3e0c0d7aa7ce3e0f4b5ce64185f7a2e766eb3f0e900ca196edbd6cda1b672105","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}